		<InfoSection imageSrc={meatballImage.src} imagePosition="left">
			<h2>About Us</h2>
			<p>
				The Mechatronics and Robotics Society (MARS) at UVA is a
				student-run, experiential learning engineering team dedicated to
				teaching members and creating leaders in STEM.
			</p>
			<p>
				Every year, we build Moon robots for the
				<a
					href="https://www.nasa.gov/learning-resources/lunabotics-challenge/"
					style="color:black">NASA Lunabotics Challenge</a
				>. This year, our robots will mine lunar regolith (lunar soil)
				and construct berms.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>
					Gain hands-on experience in design, machining, circuitry,
					and coding
				</li>
				<li>
					Practice organizing and collaborating with a professional
					engineering team
				</li>
				<li>
					Volunteer to promote STEM in the Charlottesville community
				</li>
				<li>Based out of Lacy Hall at the University of Virginia</li>
			</ul>
		</InfoSection>
		<InfoSection imageSrc={arenaImage.src} imagePosition="right">
			<h2>Lunabotics Challenge</h2>
			<p>
				An annual challenge for ~60 universities to design and build
				autonomous rovers for lunar tasks supporting NASA's Artemis
				Mission.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<strong>Objective:</strong> Mine regolith and construct a regolith-based
					berm to protect lunar landings.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Significance:</strong> Supports Artemis goals for sustained
					Moon habitation and future Mars missions.
				</li>
				<li><strong>Requirements:</strong></li>
				<ul class="sublist">
					<li>
						Build a rover from scratch to compete at annual
						competition.
					</li>
					<li>
						Submit a systems engineering paper outlining design.
					</li>
					<li>Submit an outreach paper detailing K-12 engagement.</li>
				</ul>
				<li>
					<strong>Innovation:</strong> Exceptional designs may inspire NASA
					excavation devices for Moon or Mars deployment.
				</li>
			</ul>
		</InfoSection>
		<InfoSection center={true}>
			<h2>Get Involved</h2>
			<p>
				We’d love your help. If you're a student interested in joining,
				please reach out to us at <a
					href="mailto:mars_contact@virginia.edu"
					>mars_contact@virginia.edu</a
				> or attend a meeting.
			</p>

			<div class="meeting-grid">
				<!-- General Body Meeting - Full Width Hero Card -->
				<div class="meeting-card gbm-card">
					<div class="card-header">
						<h3>General Body Meetings</h3>
					</div>
					<div class="time-slot gbm-time">
						<span class="day">Sundays</span>
						<span class="hours">1:00–4:00 PM</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Mechanical -->
				<div class="meeting-card" style="border-top-color: #9b81cf;">
					<h3>Mechanical</h3>
					<div class="subteam-group">
						<span class="subteam-title">Training Team</span>
						<div class="time-slot">
							<span class="day">Mondays</span>
							<span class="hours">5:30–7:30 PM</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="subteam-group">
						<span class="subteam-title">Competition Team</span>
						<div class="time-slot">
							<span class="day">Tuesdays</span>
							<span class="hours">6:30–8:30 PM</span>
						</div>
						<div class="time-slot">
							<span class="day">Fridays</span>
							<span class="hours">5:00–7:00 PM</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Software -->
				<div class="meeting-card" style="border-top-color: #ad1457;">
					<h3>Software</h3>
					<div class="time-slot">
						<span class="day">Wednesdays</span>
						<span class="hours">5:00–7:00 PM</span>
					</div>
					<div class="time-slot">
						<span class="day">Fridays</span>
						<span class="hours">4:00–6:00 PM</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Electrical -->
				<div class="meeting-card" style="border-top-color: #66ca93;">
					<h3>Electrical</h3>
					<div class="time-slot">
						<span class="day">Tuesdays</span>
						<span class="hours">6:00–8:00 PM</span>
					</div>
					<div class="time-slot">
						<span class="day">Fridays</span>
						<span class="hours">4:30–6:30 PM</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Systems -->
				<div class="meeting-card" style="border-top-color: #c27c0e;">
					<h3>Systems</h3>
					<div class="time-slot">
						<span class="day">Mondays</span>
						<span class="hours">7:30–9:00 PM</span>
					</div>
					<div class="time-slot">
						<span class="day">Thursdays</span>
						<span class="hours">7:00–8:30 PM</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Science -->
				<div class="meeting-card" style="border-top-color: #1da1a7;">
					<h3>Science</h3>
					<div class="time-slot">
						<span class="day">Fridays</span>
						<span class="hours">5:00–7:00 PM</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Operations -->
				<div class="meeting-card" style="border-top-color: #628df8;">
					<h3>Operations</h3>
					<div class="time-slot">
						<span class="day">Wednesdays</span>
						<span class="hours">7:00–8:00 PM</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</InfoSection>
		<InfoSection center={true}>
			<div class="row">
				<InfoTile title="Sponsors" icon="🤝">
					We accept any donation, no matter the size. Your donations
					provide the resources necessary for the team to inspire new
					generations to develop essential engineering skills. Also,
					we'd love to hear about the various opportunities available
					to our members! We highly appreciate advice from
					professionals in the workplace.
				</InfoTile>
				<InfoTile title="Mentors" icon="🧠">
					Are you interested in teaching and demonstrating your
					passion for engineering, math and science? Become a part of
					our mechanical, electrical, or computer teams and make an
					impact on the next generation of engineers! Your experience
					and advice will be highly valued and greatly appreciated!
				</InfoTile>
				<InfoTile title="Students" icon="🔨">
					The success of the team is due to the diversity, creativity,
					and dedication of our members; responsibility and commitment
					are essential for the team to succeed. We hope that you will
					create friendships and gain skills that inspire your future
					career. You don't have to be an engineering student; we are
					always looking for people who are driven, dedicated, and
					committed!
				</InfoTile>
			</div>
		</InfoSection>
		<InfoSection id="instagram" center={true}>
			<h2>Pinned Instagram Post</h2>
			<div class="row">
				<InstagramFeed />
			</div>
			<!-- <BlogTile frontmatter={latestPost.data} /> -->
		</InfoSection>
		<InfoSection center={true}>
			<h2>Connect with MARS</h2>
			<div class="row">
				<SignUpForm />
				<ActionSection>
					<div
						style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%;"
					>
						<h3
							style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;"
						>
							Donate to MARS
						</h3>
						<p>
							Your support helps us build our lunar rover and
							inspire the next generation of engineers. Consider
							making a tax-deductible donation to MARS today!
						</p>
						<a
							href="https://www.givecampus.com/campaigns/21200/donations/new?designation=mechatronicsandroboticssociety&"
							class="button"
							target="_blank"
						>
							Donate
						</a>
					</div>
				</ActionSection>
			</div>
		</InfoSection>
		<InfoSection center={true}>
			<h2>Our Sponsors</h2>
			<p>
				We are grateful for the support of our sponsors, who help us
				build our lunar rover and inspire the next generation of
				engineers. If you are interested in sponsoring MARS, please
				contact us at <a href="mailto:mars_contact@virginia.edu"
					>mars_contact@virginia.edu</a
				>.
				<div class="row responsive" style="align-items: center;">
					<Image src={UVAEngineeringImage} alt="UVA Engineering" />
					<Image
						src={UVAParentsProgramImage}
						alt="UVA Parents Program"
					/>
					<Image src={OnshapeImage} alt="Onshape" />
				</div>
			</p>
		</InfoSection>
	</Main>

	<style>
		.row {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: row;
			gap: 40px;
			justify-content: center;
		}

		.row img {
			width: 30%;
			object-fit: contain;
			height: min-content;
		}

		.meeting-grid {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr));
			gap: 20px;
			margin: 36px auto 20px;
			text-align: left;
		}

		.meeting-card {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 12px;
			padding: 22px 24px;
			background: #ffffff;
			border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
			border-top: 4px solid #232d4b; /* UVA Navy accent */
			border-radius: 12px;
			box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(17, 35, 65, 0.05);
			transition:
				transform 0.2s ease,
				box-shadow 0.2s ease;
		}

		.meeting-card h3 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: 1.25rem;
			color: #232d4b;
			font-weight: 700;
		}

		/* Spotlight GBM Card */
		.gbm-card {
			grid-column: 1 / -1;
			border-top: 4px solid #e57200; /* UVA Orange accent */
			background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, #fbfcfe);
		}

		.gbm-card .card-header {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: space-between;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			gap: 8px;
		}

		.badge {
			font-size: 0.75rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			letter-spacing: 0.05em;
			background-color: #fff2e6;
			color: #e57200;
			padding: 4px 10px;
			border-radius: 9999px;
			border: 1px solid #ffd8b3;
		}

		.gbm-time {
			font-size: 1.15rem;
		}

		/* Mechanical Subteam Hierarchy */
		.subteam-group {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 6px;
			padding-left: 10px;
			border-left: 2px solid #edf2f7;
		}

		.subteam-title {
			font-size: 0.85rem;
			font-weight: 600;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			letter-spacing: 0.04em;
			color: #64748b;
		}

		/* Individual Day & Hour Badges */
		.time-slot {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 12px;
			font-size: 0.95rem;
		}

		.time-slot .day {
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #334155;
		}

		.time-slot .hours {
			color: #64748b;
			font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
		}

		@media (max-width: 768px) {
			.row {
				gap: 20px;
			}

			.meeting-grid {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}

			.time-slot {
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: flex-start;
				gap: 2px;
			}

			.row img {
				width: 100%;
				object-fit: contain;
				margin: 10px 0;
			}
		}

		@media (max-width: 1000px) {
			.row.responsive {
				flex-wrap: wrap;
			}

			.row.responsive img {
				width: 100%;
				object-fit: contain;
				margin: 20px 0;
			}
		}

		@media (max-width: 1200px) {
			.row {
				flex-direction: column;
			}
		}

		.checkmark-list {
			list-style: none;
			padding: 0;
		}

		.checkmark-list > li::before {
			content: "\2713";
			margin: 0 0.5em;
		}

		.checkmark-list {
			margin-bottom: 8px;
		}

		.button {
			background-color: #222b48;
			color: white;
			padding: 10px 20px;
			border: none;
			border-radius: 8px;
			text-decoration: none;
			font-size: 1.1rem;
			width: 136px;
			height: 46px;
			box-sizing: border-box;
			text-align: center;
			cursor: pointer;
			transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
			display: inline-block;
			align-self: center;
			margin-top: auto;
		}

		.button:hover {
			background-color: #e57200;
		}

		#instagram {
			padding-left: 0;
			padding-right: 0;
		}

		@media (max-width: 768px) {
			#instagram {
				padding-left: 20px;
				padding-right: 20px;
			}
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
